{
 "name": "Lead Pipeline: Day-Before Reminder Sweep",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Lead Pipeline: Day-Before Reminder Sweep\nRuns hourly. Finds booked meetings starting in 23 to 25 hours, verifies each event still exists on the calendar, and sends the WhatsApp reminder template (Confirm / Reschedule buttons). A second pass catches anything missed (meetings 2 to 23 hours out) and flags those reminders as late. If the calendar event is gone, the lead is marked CANCELLED and sales is notified instead of reminding about a dead meeting.",
    "height": 200,
    "width": 940,
    "color": 5
   },
   "id": "e181479b-74ab-50a2-b921-fb06f954a6c1",
   "name": "Note: Overview",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -320,
    -160
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "### Loop pattern\nSplitInBatches drives the loop: the last node of each branch connects back to it. The Google Calendar node replaces the item, so the lead context is restored from the context Code node through the paired item index. Every send and cancellation writes a pipeline_events row, which is what the sweep summary counts.",
    "height": 160,
    "width": 760,
    "color": 5
   },
   "id": "0588f4a7-b950-5488-a918-7ab4a1fcbdb7",
   "name": "Note: Loop pattern",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    700,
    620
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "rule": {
     "interval": [
      {
       "field": "hours",
       "hoursInterval": 1
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   "id": "1bb88f34-cc39-5b2d-9093-1ee90b5a4520",
   "name": "Hourly Schedule",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.4,
   "position": [
    0,
    380
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "executeQuery",
    "query": "SELECT id, name, phone, email, event_id, meeting_start, timezone FROM leads WHERE status = 'BOOKED' AND reminder_sent = false AND meeting_start BETWEEN now() + interval '23 hours' AND now() + interval '25 hours' ORDER BY meeting_start ASC",
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "f56a2ecb-d712-58ee-af67-e9b819d6082f",
   "name": "Find Due Reminders",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
   "typeVersion": 2.7,
